            "value": "自动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic uses the local network when it reaches the computer, and the relay otherwise. Always Relay or Always LAN keeps every connection on that path; a computer paired without a relay cannot be reached with Always Relay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动：能通过局域网连接电脑时使用局域网，否则使用中继。始终中继或始终局域网会让所有连接只走该路径；配对时未设置中继的电脑在始终中继下无法连接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
