    "List Codex skills among the / commands; picking one writes its $name form. With this off, / lists commands only and $ lists skills. When an agent asks several questions together, answering one at a time shows them one by one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 / 命令中列出 Codex 技能，选中后写成 $name 形式。关闭后 / 只列出命令，输入 $ 列出技能。智能体一次提出多个问题时，逐个回答会依次显示这些问题。"
